bad:\r\ngood - \r\nfun mechanics, a pretty smooth gameplay, variety of boons and weapons, variety of challenges and high end achievements.\r\nbad -\r\nenemy aim is very prediction based, you may try to run to avoid shots, jump in the air and dash, and it works, momenterally when against one enemy or a single wave of projectiles. when facing many scatter/fast paced shooting, whether you are hit or not is a thing of luck (with a bit o skill about knowing what the incoming shots are).\r\nenemies are not observable, they might spawn behind you and you would have no idea about it, or just run under you. they have no indicator of their whereabouts in bushes, which results in (already hard to dodge) invisible barrages.\r\nlastly all this results in a black and white picture: either the run is resolved in the first area, or you gather a broken enough combo to just not care about dodging.\r\nI really hope this is a result of early access and to be fixed, i like the idea but right now the execution just fails.", "timestamp_created": 1727029735, "timestamp_updated": 1727029735, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.469561636447906494", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}]}